{"total_count": 6, "incomplete_results": false, "items": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/276", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/276/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/276/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/276/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/hukkin/tomli/pull/276", "id": 3753808687, "node_id": "PR_kwDOFhcp3c66JJS9", "number": 276, "title": "Build ARM wheels on ARM hardware", "user": {"login": "hugovk", "id": 1324225, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjQyMjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1324225?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk", "html_url": "https://github.com/hugovk", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 4, "created_at": "2025-12-22T13:27:34Z", "updated_at": "2026-01-04T19:44:43Z", "closed_at": "2026-01-04T19:43:34Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/pulls/276", "html_url": "https://github.com/hukkin/tomli/pull/276", "diff_url": "https://github.com/hukkin/tomli/pull/276.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/hukkin/tomli/pull/276.patch", "merged_at": "2026-01-04T19:43:34Z"}, "body": "~~Python 3.8 was end-of-life in October 2024 and 3.9 this October.~~\r\n\r\n~~https://devguide.python.org/versions/~~\r\n\r\nAlso:\r\n\r\n* PyPy3.10 is no longer supported, test on PyPy3.11 instead: https://pypy.org/posts/2025/07/pypy-v7320-release.html\r\n* Build ARM wheels on ARM hardware - takes [~4 minutes](https://github.com/hugovk/tomli/actions/runs/20433084217/job/58707959630) instead of [~41 minutes](https://github.com/hukkin/tomli/actions/runs/20408025787/job/58640634977)!\r\n  * Closes https://github.com/hukkin/tomli/issues/253.\r\n* Enable colour logs (`unittest` in 3.14+ has colour) and hide a pip upgrade warning in the logs\r\n* ~~Update links from `https://github.com/BurntSushi/toml-test` to `https://github.com/toml-lang/toml-test`~~\r\n\r\nLet me know if you'd prefer any of these split into their own PRs. I combined into one because the current CI config prohibits testing feature branches so I had to put them all into `master` so I could test.", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/276/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/276/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "score": 1.0}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/222", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/222/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/222/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/222/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/hukkin/tomli/pull/222", "id": 1941945877, "node_id": "PR_kwDOFhcp3c5cvTU9", "number": 222, "title": "Update toml-test", "user": {"login": "arp242", "id": 1032692, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzI2OTI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1032692?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/arp242", "html_url": "https://github.com/arp242", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arp242/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arp242/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arp242/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arp242/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arp242/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arp242/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arp242/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arp242/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arp242/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 5, "created_at": "2023-10-13T13:14:25Z", "updated_at": "2026-01-11T11:37:43Z", "closed_at": "2026-01-11T11:35:55Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/pulls/222", "html_url": "https://github.com/hukkin/tomli/pull/222", "diff_url": "https://github.com/hukkin/tomli/pull/222.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/hukkin/tomli/pull/222.patch", "merged_at": null}, "body": "This updates the test files from upstream; all additional tests are now also integrated upstream, so I removed them here. The only exception is the one that subseconds are truncated to microseconds as that's implementation defined behaviour, so I added a new unit test here.\r\n\r\nThe repo was moved from BurntSushi to toml-lang, so renamed a few things to reflect that. The iarna and \"compliance\" tests are no longer used, so simplify the code a bit as that doesn't need to be supported.\r\n\r\nMake the script executable so it can be run with the toml-test runner:\r\n\r\n\t% PYTHONPATH=./src toml-test ./tests/tomltest.py\r\n\ttoml-test v2023-10-13 [./tests/tomltest.py]: using embedded tests\r\n\t  valid tests: 166 passed,  0 failed\r\n\tinvalid tests: 355 passed,  0 failed\r\n\r\nThis gives slightly nicer errors (IMHO), and also selfishly makes it a bit easier to keep the [test matrix] updated, as I won't have to include my own script and can just run this one.\r\n\r\nI split this PR in two commits: the first one just updates the TOML and JSON files, and the second has all changes to the code. This way it's a bit easier to review.\r\n\r\n[test matrix]: https://arp242.github.io/toml-test-matrix", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/222/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/222/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "score": 1.0}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/192", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/192/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/192/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/192/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/hukkin/tomli/issues/192", "id": 1228461113, "node_id": "I_kwDOFhcp3c5JONQ5", "number": 192, "title": "Lower `z` in datetime should be valid", "user": {"login": "pwwang", "id": 1188067, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjExODgwNjc=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1188067?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/pwwang", "html_url": "https://github.com/pwwang", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pwwang/followers", "followi